mintcare (1.12.19) noble; urgency=medium

  * Optimise: new Kernel network and file hardening tweak under Security.
    It applies the Lynis sysctl suggestions that do not break VPNs, Docker
    or drivers: no ICMP redirects, no source-routed packets, logging of
    impossible addresses, protected FIFOs in shared folders and the process
    ID in core dump names. Revert restores the previous values.

